   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Atomization is a process where",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1070471,
     "content_html": "plasma torch is used to melt a cylindrical bar of the desired alloy "
    },
    {
     "id": 1070472,
     "content_html": "Existing irregularly shaped or porous particles are melted into spherical powder particles"
    },
    {
     "id": 1070473,
     "content_html": "A liquid metal stream is pushed through an orifice and mixed with flowing fluid that forces the liquid to scatter, which then solidifies into generally spherical powders"
    },
    {
     "id": 1070474,
     "content_html": "A wire feedstock is melted by plasma torches"
    }
